5a904e","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"妻からカレンダーが欲しいという相談を受けたので調査した結果、Atmoph Window を買うのが良いのではないかという結論になりつつある。\n\u003chttps://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B085NR7KG2\u003e","ts":"1620316694.265200","attachments":[{"fallback":"Atmoph Window 2 [Basic] (ブラック)","id":1,"title":"Atmoph Window 2 [Basic] (ブラック)","title_link":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B085NR7KG2","text":"Atmoph Window 2 [Basic] (ブラック)","image_url":"https://images-fe.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/I/413YUXGlDoL._SR600%2c315_PIWhiteStrip%2cBottomLeft%2c0%2c35_PIStarRatingTHREEANDHALF%2cBottomLeft%2c360%2c-6_SR600%2c315_ZA11%2c445%2c290%2c400%2c400%2cAmazonEmberBold%2c12%2c4%2c0%2c0%2c5_SCLZZZZZZZ_FMpng_BG255%2c255%2c255.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"amazon.co.jp","service_icon":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B085NR7KG2","original_url":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B085NR7KG2"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SSAYL"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01BNGU2BLK","text":"\u003c@U01BNGU2BLK\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1620316466.264300","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"c0da01f2-f807-41d6-b552-7ccd6e7cd9ed","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"一応2013年に最初のTV製品があったらしい。\n\n国内では三菱電機が2018に曲面カラーTFTを開発したって記事があった。\n\u003chttps://response.jp/article/2018/11/26/316543.html\u003e","ts":"1620378653.317700","thread_ts":"1620378206.317500","attachments":[{"fallback":"レスポンス（Response.jp）: 曲面カラーTFT液晶モジュール、三菱電機が開発…平面液晶と同等の視認性を確保 | レスポンス（Response.jp）","id":1,"title":"曲面カラーTFT液晶モジュール、三菱電機が開発…平面液晶と同等の視認性を確保 | レスポンス（Response.jp）","title_link":"https://response.jp/article/2018/11/26/316543.html","text":"三菱電機は11月26日、耐環境性と内装に高いデザイン性が求められる自動車などの表示機器向けに、平面形状と同等の高い視認性と色鮮やかな表示を実現した曲面カラーTFT液晶モジュール（凹型）を開発、量産化技術を確立したと発表した。","image_url":"https://response.jp/imgs/ogp_f/1362593.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"レスポンス（Response.jp）","service_icon":"https://response.jp/base/images/touch-icon-76.png","from_url":"https://response.jp/article/2018/11/26/316543.html","original_url":"https://response.jp/article/2018/11/26/316543.html"}],"parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3F8M"}]}]
